Implement or verify a bounded recovery engine.

Recovery flow:

Failure Detection → Classification → Safe Diagnosis → Approved Recovery Strategy → Bounded Retry → Post-Recovery Verification → User-Facing Report.

Requirements:

- Exponential backoff with a configurable cap
- Maximum retry count
- Overall timeout
- Cancellation token or equivalent lifecycle control
- Bounded recovery history
- Duplicate-recovery suppression
